---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="サーバー送信なし！安心・無料のブラウザツール集 | GlowPunch" description="データをサーバーに送らないから安心。PDF結合、背景透過、動画編集、文字数カウントなど16種類以上のツールがすべてブラウザ内で完結。インストール不要・完全無料。">
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 relative">
    <!-- Background Glow -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-full md:w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-bl from-sky-200/40 via-emerald-200/20 to-transparent blur-3xl -z-10 rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
    
    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-emerald-700 text-sm font-bold mb-2 shadow-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        データは一切サーバーに送信されません
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-800 leading-tight">
        <span class="text-slate-800">安心・無料の</span><br />
        <span class="text-sky-900">ブラウザツール集</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-medium">
        すべての処理がお使いのブラウザ内で完結。<br class="hidden md:block"/>
        あなたのファイルや入力データが外部に送られることは一切ありません。<br class="hidden md:block"/>
        インストール不要で、スマホからでもPCからでもすぐに使えます。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4 pt-4 w-full">
        <a href="#tools" class="px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          ツール一覧を見る
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/guide" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-bold rounded-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
          使い方ガイド
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex-1 relative w-full mt-10 md:mt-0 flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-[650px]">
        <img src="/images/hero-laptop-video.png" alt="Video Encoding in Browser" class="w-full h-auto object-contain mix-blend-multiply" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Start & Interactive Preview Section (ファーストビュー直下の機能体験導線) -->
  <section class="mb-8 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-64 h-64 bg-sky-100/60 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-emerald-100/60 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-100">
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-sky-50 text-sky-600 rounded-full text-xs font-bold mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          今すぐ体験・クイックスタート
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800">
          主要ツールをその場で体験・クイック起動
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm md:text-base mt-1 font-medium">
          インストール・登録不要。タブを切り替えて操作感をプレビュー＆1クリックで専用ツールへ直行できます。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Start Tool Chips / Direct Jump CTAs -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <a href="/tools/heic-converter" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-sm">
          <span>📸</span> HEIC変換
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/pdf-editor" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-red-50 text-red-700 border border-red-200 hover:bg-red-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-sm">
          <span>📄</span> PDF結合
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/character-counter" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-200 hover:bg-sky-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-sm">
          <span>✍️</span> 文字数カウント
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/background-remover" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-pink-50 text-pink-700 border border-pink-200 hover:bg-pink-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-sm">
          <span>🖼️</span> AI背景透過
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/audio-extractor" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-200 hover:bg-rose-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-sm">
          <span>🎬</span> 音声抽出
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Preview Box -->
    <div class="mt-6">
      <!-- Tabs -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6 border-b border-slate-200 pb-3" role="tablist">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="preview-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all bg-sky-500 text-white shadow-md shadow-sky-500/20"
          data-tab="char-counter"
        >
          ✍️ 文字数カウンター（体験）
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="preview-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200"
          data-tab="heic-conv"
        >
          📸 HEIC to JPG 変換
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="preview-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200"
          data-tab="pdf-edit"
        >
          📄 PDF結合・並べ替え
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="preview-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200"
          data-tab="bg-remover"
        >
          🖼️ AI 背景透過
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab Content 1: Live Interactive Character Counter -->
      <div id="panel-char-counter" class="preview-panel block">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-6">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-center">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">文字数</div>
              <div id="preview-stat-chars" class="text-2xl font-black text-sky-600">38</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-center">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">単語数</div>
              <div id="preview-stat-words" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-700">2</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-center">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">行数</div>
              <div id="preview-stat-lines" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-700">1</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-center">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">空白除く</div>
              <div id="preview-stat-nospace" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-700">38</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <textarea
              id="preview-text-input"
              rows="3"
              class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl p-3 text-slate-800 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 transition-all resize-none"
              placeholder="ここに直接文字を入力すると、上の文字数がリアルタイムでカウントされます..."
            >GlowPunchは完全無料・ブラウザ完結のセキュアなツール集です。</textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-2">
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-emerald-500"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              入力内容はサーバーへ送信されず端末内だけで瞬時に処理されます
            </div>
            <a href="/tools/character-counter" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-sky-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
              文字数カウンター専用ページで使う
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab Content 2: HEIC Converter Preview -->
      <div id="panel-heic-conv" class="preview-panel hidden">
        <div class="bg-emerald-50/50 border border-emerald-200/70 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6">
            <div class="flex-1 w-full border-2 border-dashed border-emerald-300 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center bg-white/70 hover:bg-white transition-colors">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg>
              </div>
              <p class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-1">iPhoneの .heic 画像をドラッグ＆ドロップ</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">JPG または PNG へ瞬時に変換（複数ファイル・高画質対応）</p>
              <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold">
                変換先：JPG / PNG / WebP を選択可能
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 space-y-3 w-full">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold text-sm">✓ 高速変換</span>
                <span class="text-slate-600 text-xs">端末のパワーを活用し待ち時間なくローカル変換</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm">
                <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold text-sm">✓ プライベート保護</span>
                <span class="text-slate-600 text-xs">家族・プライベート写真も一切サーバー送信なし</span>
              </div>
              <div class="pt-2">
                <a href="/tools/heic-converter" class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-emerald-600/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                  HEIC to JPG コンバータを起動する
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab Content 3: PDF Editor Preview -->
      <div id="panel-pdf-edit" class="preview-panel hidden">
        <div class="bg-red-50/40 border border-red-200/70 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6">
            <div class="flex-1 w-full">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 p-4 bg-white/80 rounded-2xl border border-red-100">
                <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-center bg-slate-50 shadow-sm">
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-red-500 mb-1">PAGE 1</div>
                  <div class="w-full h-12 bg-slate-200 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-slate-500">契約書.pdf</div>
                </div>
                <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-center bg-slate-50 shadow-sm">
                  <div class="text-xs font-bold text-red-500 mb-1">PAGE 2</div>
                  <div class="w-full h-12 bg-slate-200 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-slate-500">別紙1.pdf</div>
                </div>
                <div class="border border-dashed border-red-300 rounded-xl p-3 text-center bg-red-50/50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="text-xl text-red-500 font-bold">+</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-red-600 font-bold">追加結合</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 space-y-3 w-full">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base">複数PDFの結合・ページの並び替え</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                機密性の高い契約書や領収書も、外部サーバーへ一切送信せずにブラウザ上だけで結合・抽出・並び替えが完結します。
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2">
                <a href="/tools/pdf-editor" class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-red-600/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                  PDF結合・並べ替えツールを使う
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab Content 4: AI Background Remover Preview -->
      <div id="panel-bg-remover" class="preview-panel hidden">
        <div class="bg-pink-50/40 border border-pink-200/70 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6">
            <div class="flex-1 w-full bg-white/80 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-pink-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-center">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 block mb-1">元画像</span>
                <span class="text-3xl">🖼️</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-pink-500 font-extrabold text-xl">➔</div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[radial-gradient(#e5e7eb_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:8px_8px] bg-slate-50 border border-pink-300">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-pink-600 block mb-1">透過PNG</span>
                <span class="text-3xl">✨</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 space-y-3 w-full">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base">ワンクリックで被写体を自動認識＆背景透過</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                ブラウザ内のAIモデル（WebAssembly）が人物や商品を識別。写真をアップロードするだけで一瞬で透過PNGを生成します。
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2">
                <a href="/tools/background-remover" class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-pink-600/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                  AI 背景透過ツールを試す
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 py-8 md:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left gap-4 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-emerald-100">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">ブラウザ内で完結</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-medium">データは端末内で安全に処理</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left gap-4 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-blue-100">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">インストール不要</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-medium">すぐに使えて、いつでも便利</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left gap-4 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-purple-100">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">スマホ・PC対応</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-medium">場所を選ばずどこでも使える</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <div class="text-center mb-12 mt-12" id="tools">
    <h2 class="inline-block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 relative z-10">
      すべてのツール
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-3 bg-emerald-400/30 -z-10 rounded-full transform -skew-x-12"></div>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-24">
    <!-- HEIC Converter Card -->
    <a href="/tools/heic-converter" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-50/30 md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform text-white">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">HEIC to JPG コンバータ</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
